      "exact_source": "The 1965 has all the scars and blemishes I expected ... Of course, both of these lighters still show wear to the finish",
      "current_narration": "而這只外殼上，原先的表面磨損，也跟著回來了。",
      "current_prompt": "Close-up of A worn plain warm brass hinged metal case resting on a wooden tabletop, gentle side light.",
      "issue_zh": "e05–e08明確講同包普通銀色款的replacement hinge；e09「這只」承接它，畫面卻切回整套prompt用作帶環Camden的warm brass主物。兩只都留磨損，所以文字本身有來源；問題在本景把不同物件指代配成同一只，違反claims既定各是各的case限制。",
